    Guard KVM timestamp dispatch by subscription
    
    Preserve unsubscribed RDTSCP faults instead of delivering them through Tool::handle_rdtsc_event. Add a regression that fails on the prior unconditional decoder while retaining continuous timestamp and lifecycle coverage.

